WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.541
Namaste.

00:00:00.541 --> 00:00:07.513
Is video mein hum The Ray ko Hardware aur Building Material ki dukaan ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:10.221
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:10.221 --> 00:00:18.411
Hardware business mein do cheezein sabse zyada important hain: warranty wale saaman ka record, aur contractors ka udhaar.

00:00:18.731 --> 00:00:21.792
Ye Shree Hardware and Paints ka Home screen hai.

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:25.809
Dhyan dijiye To collect aur To pay vendors ke number bade hain.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:33.333
Hardware mein contractor mahine bhar udhaar lete hain, aur dukandaar apne suppliers ko bhi udhaar par maal uthata hai.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:37.542
Isliye yahan dono taraf ka paisa ek nazar mein dikhna zaroori hai.

00:00:37.899 --> 00:00:45.284
Ab warranty wale item ka bill. Existing customer mein Manoj Shinde ko chunte hain, jo ek contractor hai.

00:00:45.284 --> 00:00:52.030
Phir Philips LED Bulb aur Bosch Drill Machine jodte hain. In dono par warranty hai, ek saal ki.

00:00:52.422 --> 00:00:58.838
Contractor ne poora paisa nahi diya. Complete bill dabakar part payment likhte hain, paanch sau rupaye.

00:00:58.838 --> 00:01:03.074
Baaki ka balance contractor ke khata mein udhaar chadh jayega. Kyun?

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:10.673
Kyunki hardware mein bade bill aur mahine ke hisaab ka udhaar roz ki baat hai, aur usko yaad rakhna insaan ke bas ka nahi.

00:01:11.049 --> 00:01:15.593
Dekhiye, invoice ban gaya aur usme warranty wale items ka record ban gaya.

00:01:15.593 --> 00:01:21.980
Customer ka phone number bill ke saath jud gaya hai, isliye baad mein warranty isi number se mil jayegi.

00:01:22.369 --> 00:01:28.676
Ab Customers. Yahan contractors ki list hai, har naam ke saamne unka baaki udhaar.

00:01:28.676 --> 00:01:37.445
Jinke paas GSTIN hai, unke bill B2B invoice ban jaate hain, aur wo seedha aapke GSTR 1 mein sahi jagah jaate hain.

00:01:37.445 --> 00:01:44.060
Kyun? Kyunki GSTIN wale customer ka bill galat bane to unka input credit ruk jata hai.

00:01:44.441 --> 00:01:55.124
Kisi contractor ko kholo to poora khata dikhta hai: kitna business hua, kitna diya, kitna baaki hai, aur har bill aur payment ki history.

00:01:55.124 --> 00:01:59.725
Remind dabao to WhatsApp par yaad dilane ka message tayyar.

00:01:59.725 --> 00:02:05.652
Ye isliye ki contractor se paisa maangna aasan aur professional ho jata hai.

00:02:06.909 --> 00:02:08.242
Ab Warranty lookup.

00:02:08.242 --> 00:02:15.676
Jab koi customer kahe ki drill kharab ho gaya, to aap uska phone number ya invoice number yahan likhte ho.

00:02:15.676 --> 00:02:17.920
Hum Manoj ka number likhte hain.

00:02:18.295 --> 00:02:23.232
Dekhiye, us customer ke saare warranty items aur unka bill saamne aa gaya.

00:02:23.232 --> 00:02:27.902
Dukandaar turant bata sakta hai ki warranty chalu hai ya khatam. Kyun?

00:02:27.902 --> 00:02:33.306
Bahes aur kaagaz dhundhne ka waqt bachta hai, aur customer ka bharosa badhta hai.

00:02:33.679 --> 00:02:38.495
Ab Purchases. Hardware mein maal vendors se udhaar par aata hai.

00:02:38.495 --> 00:02:46.320
Purchase mein vendor ka bill, items, GST aur input credit likhte hain, aur stock apne aap badh jata hai.

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:49.330
Yahin se vendor ko payment bhi hoti hai.

00:02:49.699 --> 00:02:54.998
Make Payment mein supplier chuno, aur dekho ki usko kitna dena baaki hai.

00:02:54.998 --> 00:02:58.555
Aap poora ya thoda thoda paisa de sakte ho. Kyun?

00:02:58.555 --> 00:03:04.870
Vendor ke saath hisaab saaf rakhne se agla maal bina jhagde udhaar par milta rehta hai.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:23.992
Aur Products. Yahan har item ka bulk rate, stock aur reorder level dikhta hai.

00:03:23.992 --> 00:03:29.703
Ultratech Cement kholte hain: bees bori ya usse zyada par sasta rate hai.

00:03:29.703 --> 00:03:36.901
Reorder level ka matlab jab stock is se neeche jaye, to app khud batata hai ki maal mangwao.

00:03:38.591 --> 00:03:39.819
Wapas Dashboard par.

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:48.602
Hardware ke liye teen kaam yahan roz milte hain: kam stock ka reorder, overdue udhaar ki vasooli, aur wo customers jo aana band kar chuke hain.

00:03:48.967 --> 00:04:00.209
Aaj humne Hardware ka flow dekha: warranty item ka bill, contractor ka part payment aur udhaar, phone se warranty lookup, vendor ko payment, aur bulk rate ka setup.

00:04:00.209 --> 00:04:10.218
Ek practical baat: warranty wale item ka bill hamesha customer ke phone number ke saath banao, warna baad mein warranty dhundhna mushkil hota hai.
